ud Drive. Updates include a roof approx. 3 years old, newer hot water tank, dishwasher, range hood and east-side fence. Come discover a home where everyday living feels a little more special! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$437,850"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","1,532 sq ft"],["Lot size","5,810 sq ft"],["Year built","1979"],["2026 City assessment","$404,500"],["Est. property tax","about $4,190/year ($349/month)"],["Neighbourhood","Hillview"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6L1V3"],["MLS® number","E4517380"],["Listed","November 24, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Storage Shed, Window Coverings, Fan"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Cooling","Central air conditioning"],["Fireplace","Wood"],["Basement","Partially finished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","3.26 m × 4.78 m (10'8\" × 15'8\")"],["Dining room","Main level","2.83 m × 3.33 m (9'3\" × 10'11\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","2.64 m × 2.74 m (8'8\" × 9'0\")"],["Family room","Lower level","3.92 m × 6.03 m (12'10\" × 19'9\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","3.98 m × 3.52 m (13'1\" × 11'7\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","3.32 m × 3.85 m (10'11\" × 12'8\")"],["Bedroom 3","Lower level","3.32 m × 3.85 m (10'11\" × 12'8\")"],["Recreation room","Basement","6.99 m × 5.00 m (22'11\" × 16'5\")"],["Utility room","Basement","3.59 m × 5.30 m (11'9\" × 17'5\")"],["Enclosed porch","Main level",""],["Storage","Basement",""]],"courtesy":"Leila Neri, Exp Realty","tax_m":349,"tax_note":{"year":2026,"per_k":"10.36","city":"Edmonton","licence":"City of Edmonton open data, licensed under the Open Government Licence – City of Edmonton","estimator":"https://taxestimator.edmonton.ca/"},"board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"hillview","area":"southeast-edmonton"}